ainst the formless  mother in order to free mikula from his  deep sleep or something along those  lines i also have a feeling that we  won't actually fight against mikala at  all but instead interact with him in  order to complete quest for him just  like we did with ronnie which would  potentially give us an option for a new  ending that involves mykola and his  halig tree honestly i'll take anything  that adds new information regarding  mikola there's so many different routes  that they could take these characters  that i have no idea what they'll decide  to do and whatever it is i'm sure it'll  be very good there's so many other  avenues of dlc that we could discuss but  those are probably the main three big  dlcs that we'd all look forward to the  badlands godwin the golden and mikla's  dream and obviously i would like to see  what they do with the coliseums that are  spread throughout the world we still  can't enter them without the use of mods  so they obviously intended to use these  at some point and it's more than likely  they'll be used for pvp updates in the  future where players can battle against  each other and maybe in a ranked  playlist of some kind i would also like  to see these coliseums used for boss  rushes where we can battle against  bosses that we've already defeated on  certain playthroughs maybe the use of  ever jails to make this easier there's  so much that they could do with these  it'd be so awesome to see more of the  things that we've been reading about in  item descriptions in the game like the  battle between malakath and the glomide  queen over the rune of death or to talk  with ronnie's mentor rena the snow witch  or just talk with ronnie herself before  she kills her body and takes the form of  the doll that we meet i'd also love to  talk with queen merica to learn more  about her plan to shatter the elden ring  in what truly caused her to do so not to  mention an explanation of how america  and radagon can be the same person but